## 🎛️ Environment Variables

### API Service ✅ Configured
- `DATABASE_URL` → Connected to PostgreSQL
- `JWT_SECRET` → Securely generated
- `NODE_ENV` → production
- `PORT` → 3001

### Frontend Service ⏳ Needs API URL
- `NODE_ENV` → production ✅
- `PORT` → 3000 ✅
- `VITE_API_URL` → ⏳ Add after API deploys

