## 📞 Quick Commands

```bash
# Check if builds are done
cloudflare status

# Get API URL (after build completes)
cloudflare open --service api

# Configure frontend
./configure-env-vars.sh <api-url>

# Get frontend URL (after redeploy)
cloudflare open --service frontend

# View all variables
cloudflare variables --service api --kv
cloudflare variables --service frontend --kv
```

---

## 🆘 If Something Goes Wrong

1. **Build fails**: Check build logs in the links above
2. **Service won't start**: Run `cloudflare logs --service api` to see errors
3. **Can't connect to database**: Verify `DATABASE_URL` is set correctly
4. **Frontend can't reach API**: Ensure CORS is configured in API

Most issues are visible in the logs. Cloudflare's build system is very reliable!

